  "notes": "<div class=\"concept-box\"><h2><span data-en=\"Topic notes\">課題需知</span></h2><div class=\"knowledge-grid\"><div><svg class=\"window-seedling\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 270\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n    <rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"250\" height=\"255\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#f4f8f1\"></rect>\n    <path d=\"M210 65 L58 38 L58 181 L210 172 Z\" fill=\"#f9d779\" opacity=\".24\"></path>\n    <rect x=\"205\" y=\"45\" width=\"43\" height=\"132\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#cfeef3\" stroke=\"#7dadae\" stroke-width=\"5\"></rect>\n    <circle cx=\"231\" cy=\"67\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#f6c45d\"></circle>\n    <path d=\"M226 46V176M207 110H247\" stroke=\"#7dadae\" stroke-width=\"4\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M199 181H253\" stroke=\"#87ada7\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M191 98H171M177 92L171 98L177 104\" stroke=\"#c28c1a\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\"></path>\n    <path data-stem=\"after\" d=\"M100 207 L100 140 C100 110 123 89 156 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#59a16a\" stroke-width=\"13\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><circle data-rounded-tip=\"true\" cx=\"156\" cy=\"78\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"#59a16a\"></circle>\n    <path d=\"M100 207 L100 140 C100 110 123 89 156 78\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a1d38a\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n    <path d=\"M28 249H248\" stroke=\"#d5e1d5\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n    <rect x=\"60\" y=\"205\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#af7851\"></rect>\n    <path d=\"M66 219L77 248H123L134 219\" fill=\"#d6a878\"></path>\n  </svg></div><ul class=\"topic-points\"><li><span data-en=\"Phototropism is growth in response to light direction. Shoots usually grow towards light (positive phototropism). The left diagram shows a bending coleoptile: part of the seedling’s shoot that protects young leaves.\">向光性是對光照方向的定向生長。枝條通常呈正向光性，朝向光源生長。左圖顯示胚芽鞘朝光彎曲；它屬幼苗地上部的一部分，包裹並保護幼葉。</span></li><li><span data-en=\"The tip senses light from one side and contains auxin, a chemical substance that is a plant hormone. More auxin passes down the shaded side, stimulating cells in the elongation region to elongate and promote growth.\">頂端感受單側光照，並含有生長素（一種化學物質，屬於植物激素）。單側光照下，較多生長素沿背光側向下傳遞，刺激延長區的細胞延長，促進生長。</span></li><li><span data-en=\"Agar allows chemical substances to pass through it.\">瓊脂容許化學物質通過。</span></li></ul></div><svg class=\"mechanism-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 820 390\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"左側光照下，完整頂端的胚芽鞘背光側生長素較多；放大圖顯示背光側細胞延長較多，使胚芽鞘向光彎曲。\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"395\" height=\"375\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#edf8f2\"></rect><rect x=\"420\" y=\"5\" width=\"395\" height=\"375\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#edf8f2\"></rect><g data-paper-light-beams=\"true\" fill=\"#f7d95b\" opacity=\".32\"><path d=\"M43 92L125 61V191L43 147Z\"></path><path d=\"M450 78L550 45V325L450 246Z\"></path></g>\n  <path d=\"M202 310L202 240C202 196 167 150 133 131\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#65a772\" stroke-width=\"26\"></path><circle data-intact-tip=\"true\" cx=\"133\" cy=\"131\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#65a772\"></circle><path d=\"M212 306L212 240C213 191 171 143 139 122\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d5e989\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><g data-auxin-dots=\"true\"><circle cx=\"144.5\" cy=\"128.9\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"197.9\" cy=\"204\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"178.8\" cy=\"158.1\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"152.2\" cy=\"133\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"199.8\" cy=\"190.3\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"189.3\" cy=\"182\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"190.9\" cy=\"188.3\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"182.5\" cy=\"169\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"202.8\" cy=\"200.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"151.2\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"157.4\" cy=\"145.5\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle cx=\"194.9\" cy=\"182.2\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#d94b4b\"></circle><circle